{"2089530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Parawyrm", "steam_appid": 2089530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>S T O R Y  M O D E</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You are Kiefer, K- an investigative journalist in search of the paranormal. Upon receiving word of paranormal activity outside a small town in rural Victoria, Australia- you take it upon yourself to investigate...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Parawyrm is a unique survival horror experience like no other where enemies and hazards will challenge your very senses... Explore a seamless world with collectables to find and secrets to uncover. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle a roster of <strong>Unique Entities</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid <strong>Dangerous Hazards</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric</strong>/ <strong>Immersive</strong> <strong>World</strong> to <strong>Explore</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Environment</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield an <strong>Arsenal of Unique Items</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interesting <strong>Torch Mechanics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to <strong>Blink</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No</strong> scripted <strong>Jump Scares</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectables</strong> to <strong>Find</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Documents</strong> to <strong>Read</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles </strong>to <strong>Solve</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixelated (<i>customizable</i>)<strong> Retro Aesthetic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_p